" Holds GUI status SALVAGE_FULLSCREEN, which ZCL_SALVAGE sets for fullscreen lists with own
" buttons. Besides the standard ALV functions the status has ten button slots, SALVAGE01 to
" SALVAGE10, whose texts are dynamic and read from ZCL_SALVAGE=>SLOT_TEXTS.
" The program has no logic of its own and cannot be started.
PROGRAM zsalvage_gui.
